    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0002",
      "source_text_sha256": "9f57a16979d9624fe8a0a9d719618630bf6013213ef221409d05fa97a1b9372c",
      "translation": "三贤人厅",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/three-sages-chamber"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：place/three-sages-chamber。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0003",
      "source_text_sha256": "8c19d33d58b9ffd44d67432a8add50727b4faaadf240142130b9c6fc5756ac9c",
      "translation": "〜新地球联邦总部　贤人会议〜",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-federation",
        "organization/new-earth-federation"
      ],
      "notes": "嵌套词表子串自动例外：organization/earth-federation"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0004",
      "source_text_sha256": "7c40f9de3473f684767e32c0ca53a63dbfa62a11087d306d69be17a235d0fc54",
      "translation": "“……奇拉姆拒绝了时空控制技术的提供？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0005",
      "source_text_sha256": "59922d5549fba2da0d65fecd8fb15cb12c389ea4a7366cc12eb3c7f1a9e65911",
      "translation": "“嗯……他们似乎打算推进那个D计划，\n　靠自己的力量修复时空。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0006",
      "source_text_sha256": "e952181b09df2ee726d03f02b4fc87bbe370dd77bc8ed0877ca937961377c7ea",
      "translation": "“换句话说，\n　他们是想按奇拉姆的意愿重塑世界吗……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0007",
      "source_text_sha256": "e6c67e1af83c6ad3df55b67433e23e58ab7d2707382c5435d6a145c30bc85427",
      "translation": "“奇拉姆那帮家伙……\n　难道还抱着世界崩坏之前的体制不放吗。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "event/break-the-world",
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": "",
      "glossary_exceptions": [
        "people/ray"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0008",
      "source_text_sha256": "ad1ee155c909e4615a1e1f7dad40979995ab28a372b7bb4ee31cae3ddecb5da8",
      "translation": "“那是由时空破坏导致时间轴偏移，被提前\n　20年抛到多元世界的人们建立的国家啊。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0009",
      "source_text_sha256": "3259770617a2b9106a904a13264fbfaa3f9f2661d3029d5f1ba3e91c993235cf",
      "translation": "“听说其母体是与旧地球联合中\n　心的大西洋联邦对立的国家。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/earth-alliance"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0010",
      "source_text_sha256": "b7b88d068b6ff94813812cae6e911508aeb4143209c2e5a7734dd95fc7cd64bb",
      "translation": "“而且，凭借这20年的优势，\n　他们拥有我们没有的时空控制技术。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0011",
      "source_text_sha256": "403cbe9a24ed0d0f356c55eaf6fd4a9c8c2e84cf828de3fe18122f569fe2c22f",
      "translation": "“加米托夫·海曼！\n　这是你作为谈判代表的失职！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0012",
      "source_text_sha256": "0f9ccda4afcf40af0df430ec55d43c850c01902d3e35b6ccc732d2aaff4d1a05",
      "translation": "“奇拉姆可能会以D计划为盾牌，\n　逼迫我们服从！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0013",
      "source_text_sha256": "e10dc6087319d751a95e64f39ce2fbe003edf2a79bd10cd189fdfa9fde8d9751",
      "translation": "“冷静点，吉布利尔。\n　奇拉姆也还没完成时空控制系统。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0014",
      "source_text_sha256": "1911d6611db8ae37478430ee4842698162a3c8d63d9b8406b9753ce6cbbee39d",
      "translation": "“而且，\n　他们也没有确信那系统能完全运作吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0015",
      "source_text_sha256": "095073a1b9e29aa925403c748eb156fdb96523e79f7a1b7066dfa8c96581bdc6",
      "translation": "“据杜威的报告，\n　奇拉姆和埃曼都在继续追踪奇点。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/emaan",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": "采用项目研究过的人名“杜威”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0016",
      "source_text_sha256": "8d1ee9dcdc7ba94c8345c33fc821632239ab9b78a9a7ee58eadb8db83b99d002",
      "translation": "“也就是说，他们可能把通过奇点修复时空，\n　当作D计划失败时的保险。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0017",
      "source_text_sha256": "ff3ebc0b846f4ba9c96681dd366f75035089e562129ec3b51ba3f6d184539747",
      "translation": "“那么，我们应该比他们更早捕获那个奇点！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0018",
      "source_text_sha256": "774bd99a9fb48b112091221b1697732ad5ded1e77143a2297aa83ae02c3ca043",
      "translation": "“为此我已经调动了凤蝶队。……而且，一旦\n　凤蝶构想完成，就连那个奇点都不需要了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/ageha-team",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0019",
      "source_text_sha256": "09d2e2ee281b3b715fc666a5e41d7b08af03c0a509f0ff83ff1592e6ec0baa55",
      "translation": "“件之极限……那个会破坏多元世界\n　之理的东西，无论如何都必须阻止。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "concept/limit-of-questions",
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：concept/limit-of-questions。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0020",
      "source_text_sha256": "9714318bfe949652835440c5e63c382440f01977994cb89aa523f5190e2abd0b",
      "translation": "“为此我才让杜威·诺瓦克复职。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "采用项目研究过的人名“杜威”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0021",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0022",
      "source_text_sha256": "0008bc77ffe8a9def6cb9870cc85623f5980f9d45277b8f0b0e1bd4a13d92437",
      "translation": "“而且，不配合地球联邦的奇拉姆，\n　只是碍事的存在。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram",
        "organization/earth-federation"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0023",
      "source_text_sha256": "74273f9934301637f6191f5467aba3021674fd2f300d4a50a0aa18e028e23ecf",
      "translation": "“好机会。把那台机体投入奇拉姆吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0024",
      "source_text_sha256": "58d204cd9281b30e5499d8a1157aa982f2da901b444049bb525db832c33b339e",
      "translation": "“请等一下。在这个时机进攻奇拉姆，\n　没有任何好处。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/chiram"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0025",
      "source_text_sha256": "86c844c39363d26c8f18b6e071c9b0b55c7bd39253278750285ff64197232228",
      "translation": "“如果他们有自己的时空修复方案，我们应该互\n　相拿出计划，探讨阻止世界崩溃的最佳方法。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0026",
      "source_text_sha256": "faf11633ddabfa458e058a768fbe16024774a5df80fd4b338cfa3aac20704ff4",
      "translation": "“艾岱尔准将……\n　那用奇点或凤蝶队就能做到。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/ageha-team",
        "technology/singularity"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0027",
      "source_text_sha256": "d58b37a193710a5948334b7e4f3717ce56875b342a391e238b80b9728819af27",
      "translation": "“我们应该考虑的，已经是下一个阶段了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0028",
      "source_text_sha256": "9c8ac8b27e16b2840ed9fc839dd33c69d0c7530c31977faf38f3e2376b3265ce",
      "translation": "“这……世界一旦崩溃，\n　一切都会归于虚无啊。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0029",
      "source_text_sha256": "5b59a98c8ef591bbd19fed3774d0ec7a8bd68689a0e65b4b1799107227c7b4eb",
      "translation": "“注意你的言辞，艾岱尔·贝尔纳尔……！”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/edel-bernal"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0030",
      "source_text_sha256": "c2e59d1b7fba737101a3c34360aa90b3509d4bc34698a68ff4f297bcce1a32be",
      "translation": "“加米托夫总帅说得对。……这个贤人会议，\n　是为了统御多元世界而存在的。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/multiverse"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0031",
      "source_text_sha256": "0d4fcf3c0c2e8407a9d4e2179357f0c083a77a752a1821ce3b116edd8e35e570",
      "translation": "“虽然你只是末席，但让你参加是看\n　中UN的贡献。要认清自己的身份。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/un-network"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0032",
      "source_text_sha256": "fe5257bef6b55a5aeb27d92c2fdeabc38d3af2dfbdbc669184eed16b779afb98",
      "translation": "“……是。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0033",
      "source_text_sha256": "c255c6fe1c5df1a1a6d49dfbb19f994ffbfd469f2f0aeaa95f1b00c950445a10",
      "translation": "（哼……以LOGOS的经济实力为\n　后盾的贤人会议，终究只是装饰……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": "采用项目研究过的组织名“LOGOS”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0034",
      "source_text_sha256": "7d9ef3de34da541e244daebda4c801148c3bae47b721efd193c7491706800365",
      "translation": "（总有一天，\n　也要让这些老家伙们明白这一点……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0035",
      "source_text_sha256": "668bbbd47b64197d2dc7473861b6a548b604dd7dee3a25830f3f1f4779583318",
      "translation": "“这个世界不会毁灭。而且，统御世界、\n　引导人类走向更好方向，是我们的职责。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0036",
      "source_text_sha256": "8d970bfb0c4809f9e40b640e5c4ced2b45359c846be66888f86988f15063a7a8",
      "translation": "“绝不能把这个世界交给迪兰达尔之流。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/durandal"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0037",
      "source_text_sha256": "aad5a4355392a03e3ae46cae18efe6797f2eb14883d790e6e447f15ebd1a6413",
      "translation": "（被眼前利益束缚的人，\n　没有预见未来的能力……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0038",
      "source_text_sha256": "1cbab45b183c4b1ec780cacfe0c0603844013aac0a8b58b5c6811d45f95430d6",
      "translation": "（也许这里的这些人，\n　才是把世界封闭在黑暗中的人……）",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0039",
      "source_text_sha256": "f08dac9ab391a8010b0352703dab3c36bd234f09c0633da5eff7b3e8137164f6",
      "translation": "黑屏",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "script/black-screen"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
