      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/argama-private-room",
        "unit/argama"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：place/argama-private-room。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0045",
      "source_text_sha256": "ab10ca4fc3a77b110feb1d3bbe1ab660d335d499fc297325420e0516729d6c65",
      "translation": "〜阿伽玛单人房〜",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/argama-private-room",
        "unit/argama"
      ],
      "notes": "按日文源词绑定统一全局术语：place/argama-private-room。"
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0046",
      "source_text_sha256": "10a6b9d89f51d1bf6bd18309556f3985411a312089a57b20d915748b2baf2309",
      "translation": "“……打扰了，蕾柯亚少尉。\n　我给您送饭来了。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0047",
      "source_text_sha256": "a7bc33463507acdbb1f75297ad3ba8e00c0543fc5a4a36f77e56db3f4f2863f6",
      "translation": "“给你添麻烦了，真抱歉，$n。\n　还有花也来了，谢谢。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0048",
      "source_text_sha256": "531436a1d538c16657b3ec6e4b097fefed452b113026577329fd993e948abf84",
      "translation": "“哪、哪里，没有的事……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0049",
      "source_text_sha256": "b664ce2eb494b5ab2fbe0e10031f7228fda8b980a3509ab5c7fe33c07025f58e",
      "translation": "“我……上次战斗中您救了我，\n　我却还没道谢……所以……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0050",
      "source_text_sha256": "89f942d049c5dc10796b45e1f60bd568a79640de525a79b4cdd8441b4ba176b7",
      "translation": "“没关系……我只有在战斗中才能派上用场。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0051",
      "source_text_sha256": "c40ef8272baf243d2c44aeb91158e9dbb41cd438887c7e87d5539c18480f6d4e",
      "translation": "“蕾柯亚少尉……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0052",
      "source_text_sha256": "ac2e1bf0cb3b991e45f4931eb6edf1831b50083a7931e4343ba8b729cdd087fe",
      "translation": "“……对不起，$n……\n　在担心我的你们面前，说这种泄气话……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0053",
      "source_text_sha256": "fffb50f370217a37bd81c2c95be978a48fe5b0a9076d92f4ee5f16e087de8b40",
      "translation": "“……这种时候，说出来反而会轻松些吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0054",
      "source_text_sha256": "2c9ca8a90ff73fd3cf69c41101cde8e540446046e01a46974c32ec7283786a23",
      "translation": "“……不行啊……年纪大了，\n　有时自己的话反而会让自己更消沉……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0055",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0056",
      "source_text_sha256": "231cf8a1b107d52af22cad28d92897a8a295fb9fbb3d504ca719a01698a6c059",
      "translation": "“……花……可以问你吗？\n　你奋不顾身救卡缪的时候，在想什么？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/kamille"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0057",
      "source_text_sha256": "d87b653d2f8ce08a1eeff4a28ba40f0abba464ff0b4d4aa374cb8e90a6d539c0",
      "translation": "“啊……那时我太投入了，\n　根本没空想什么……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0058",
      "source_text_sha256": "71a6f36537e8f66933183ae019edd745189e635da4e8e191bf0c888ae28cd444",
      "translation": "“……那就够了。\n　想保护卡缪，这就是你的战斗。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/kamille"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0059",
      "source_text_sha256": "24ef75b32fb632c74997b7756a45278a8e5ebaae55a18bb6c0263c4445bfc0db",
      "translation": "“诶……？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0060",
      "source_text_sha256": "1603ed1a4fa831d267d4d4bfd8218b288a0363a6a1446cf6275ec5573f7e3fef",
      "translation": "“我已经失去了……自己战斗的初衷……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0061",
      "source_text_sha256": "cf8343c1ca89ff5e043b46942c2991cb2908705f61eceebc001356ec8e43d261",
      "translation": "“战斗的初衷……？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0062",
      "source_text_sha256": "2a93f557734b904643ef3958641d788154fa94bca6be591675c1ee7b9666726f",
      "translation": "“对$n来说，\n　就像荣耀之星的骄傲……活着的意义一样吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/glory-star"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0063",
      "source_text_sha256": "c40ef8272baf243d2c44aeb91158e9dbb41cd438887c7e87d5539c18480f6d4e",
      "translation": "“蕾柯亚少尉……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0064",
      "source_text_sha256": "5a11ad2225922b9b01f28a04e9982e2bce36d6c2a31ebe01d64ff1ed91e498c7",
      "translation": "“我最初也有战斗的意义……\n　加入奥古时，也有理想……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/aeug"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0065",
      "source_text_sha256": "1b6b774779fdf4e1b1063674cc357c5e8672011ba0dd6ae967dfacafda188d0f",
      "translation": "“但现在，我想不起来了……\n　在看不到未来的世界里，\n　漫无目的地战斗，就像在夜海里游泳……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0066",
      "source_text_sha256": "39b57981646e9f7e84fe9c82c6a4aa9fa4a38351ac054b550b7f68d4e0244581",
      "translation": "“总有一天会失去一切，沉下去……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0067",
      "source_text_sha256": "0d1dd55ecdfb25be5c0aecd0e19363179c8fcb77953b77f7ff1e6cba20adff65",
      "translation": "“您是太累了，蕾柯亚少尉。\n　马上就到直布罗陀了，请休息吧。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "place/gibraltar"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0068",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0069",
      "source_text_sha256": "9afb3e7741452ff2e644c9b9b71cc62637360d4ffe9ac6f612e4fd85c08edba9",
      "translation": "“……是啊……睡一觉，\n　也许心情会好一些……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0070",
      "source_text_sha256": "f90633b5723eed1a935ee6c856af44953d557166a6c2404ae0032dee2b7cbe7a",
      "translation": "“我把饭放在这里，请一定吃一点。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0071",
      "source_text_sha256": "852d3ee1429890d2420f08d5ffb88514bc374a8a702994cb8b730215a9661f82",
      "translation": "“谢谢你们俩……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0072",
      "source_text_sha256": "e4ede3b46eac1654e68208c9a8cf62f70c4293141c96b0b132164e2430fd739a",
      "translation": "“那么，我们告辞了……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0073",
      "source_text_sha256": "5d51637b02586cf83b9397027efd5c838c4254e9e448f489f28dbdf1397fa0d0",
      "translation": "“……醒来之后，又得战斗……\n　为了什么……为了活下去……？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0074",
      "source_text_sha256": "a01d47e3b838d933ec0fc6f2b326d59d9bca240c262f1383aa50609dd0770cfa",
      "translation": "“……就算活下来，\n　回到这里，又有什么意义……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0075",
      "source_text_sha256": "4a7cd450429ee7ee41e6a86ceace36f9531250d5456102a1446edfcfa04ad0c2",
      "translation": "“这里是个没人等待归来的房间啊……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0076",
      "source_text_sha256": "a3e7c91dee7423aa3f850015db192405056f88bb8b413be32e6746ea3b5bf9bf",
      "translation": "阿伽玛　通道",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "unit/argama"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0077",
      "source_text_sha256": "a3e7c91dee7423aa3f850015db192405056f88bb8b413be32e6746ea3b5bf9bf",
      "translation": "阿伽玛　通道",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "unit/argama"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0078",
      "source_text_sha256": "a3e7c91dee7423aa3f850015db192405056f88bb8b413be32e6746ea3b5bf9bf",
      "translation": "阿伽玛　通道",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "unit/argama"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0079",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0080",
      "source_text_sha256": "428b05de8bd59ff8d698cb98e2b7399d39a42f386d0e2325c47fdb52fbf0550a",
      "translation": "“怎么样，$n先生？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0081",
      "source_text_sha256": "7940768d88cecd52ba751a2825d0cac8dd322a0d7c8c77d71a068d90807c789d",
      "translation": "“蕾柯亚少尉，果然看起来很疲惫……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0082",
      "source_text_sha256": "f0cc415f5ede43f43aa1c491cc60ece919baef34240f240022c63f6825654930",
      "translation": "“她连饭都不想碰……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0083",
      "source_text_sha256": "1880d51bec2b46fb21a3d18a0e46b1322a868b392a72700a390a07865cea8f46",
      "translation": "“是吗……我看她样子不对，一直很担心……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0084",
      "source_text_sha256": "2eeb137ce8d62f84779006ac2cda53da7383a9fca43c7f4b5505f0432009dfa0",
      "translation": "“嗯……我还是第一次看到\n　蕾柯亚少尉那个样子……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0085",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0086",
      "source_text_sha256": "bd36e11fe140631ea03d7eb07131b18cd8f6e79e99b79f6221529eaf9c6b5b01",
      "translation": "“克瓦特罗大尉……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "people/quattro"
      ],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0087",
      "source_text_sha256": "e3ea1d018f146722635a767bf40c55546d1c331df5776be9c91c804b91dd87c1",
      "translation": "“蕾柯亚少尉在房间里吗？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0088",
      "source_text_sha256": "1e02d8609244927e73e642a201dba48d38edcb33a0f417f8009415109a29ec95",
      "translation": "“呃，嗯……她现在在休息。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0089",
      "source_text_sha256": "6c57db375436782e24df4a49179928b5894875fd263a6ad32b3adf36542053b9",
      "translation": "“明白了……那我改天再来。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0090",
      "source_text_sha256": "3cb91f722f18d77d3264d188985333ec8c780962c3d847a2c227a3602910d6f8",
      "translation": "“请等一下，大尉。如果可以的话，\n　您能去探望一下少尉吗？”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0091",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0092",
      "source_text_sha256": "6c05bab51d84aef9afd4d74fcc48b95df6c4bffe30574c36fa6a0b75594daf85",
      "translation": "“我觉得少尉的疲劳是心理问题。所以……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0093",
      "source_text_sha256": "2c22e7367bbdb1fb2f3cc825f73e2a185833b7fcb480949df1c177bb76dfe2bb",
      "translation": "“……要踏入别人的内心，需要相应的资格。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0094",
      "source_text_sha256": "af86e1cbd63cca59844d0db8aed87510733b4f7ea528a488afcc8be9ce0ca0c6",
      "translation": "“但是，我认为大尉您有这个资格。”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0095",
      "source_text_sha256": "566e8f936afdab8d3533ae535a952c705164202d2c256d9265f340f4245e5184",
      "translation": "“是吗……？不管多大年纪，\n　人总会在不知不觉中伤害别人啊……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "story/059/dialogue/01.01/0096",
      "source_text_sha256": "c28c880421ba36259600230d6ddbb64a6ea5083e516b1acb2062087cb8e890ce",
      "translation": "“……”",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "translation_action": "translate",
      "glossary_refs": [],
      "notes": ""
    }
  ]
}
